      "message": "Please fix this WARNING reported by autoreview issue finding: It is safer to check whether `exec_result.value` is null or holds an empty `v8::Global` before dereferencing it and creating a `v8::Local`.\n\nIf `exec_result.value` is null, `*exec_result.value` will cause a crash. If the `Global` is empty, `local_val` will be empty, which could lead to a crash when passed to `fxv8::ReentrantToBooleanHelper` (as most V8 functions do not handle empty Locals gracefully).\n\nConsider using the same pattern here as in `cxfa_node.cpp`:\n```cpp\nif (exec_result.value \u0026\u0026 !exec_result.value-\u003eIsEmpty()) {\n  CFXJSE_ScopeUtil_IsolateHandleRootContext scope(pIsolate);\n  v8::Local\u003cv8::Value\u003e local_val \u003d\n      v8::Local\u003cv8::Value\u003e::New(pIsolate, *exec_result.value);\n  bool_val \u003d fxv8::ReentrantToBooleanHelper(pIsolate, local_val);\n}\n```",
